    relevance: "Modern JavaScript (ES6+, the dialect of every current codebase) adds the class syntax over prototypes, safe deep navigation (?.), and real Map/Set collections. Reading modern code — frameworks, tooling, exploits write-ups — requires this vocabulary.",
